Prominent modification notice
-----------------------------

This distribution has been substantially modified from the upstream project.
VERTOX modifications began on 2026-08-20. The Robinhood Chain conversion was
performed in August 2026 and includes, among other changes:

- retaining the VERTOX name, CLI identity, and project artwork;
- replacing Solana/Anchor project analysis with Solidity and Vyper scanning;
- replacing sBPF disassembly with EVM bytecode disassembly and CFG generation;
- replacing Solana account/program RPC logic with Ethereum JSON-RPC methods;
- adding Robinhood Chain mainnet/testnet defaults and chain-ID validation;
- adding deployed-contract intelligence, EIP-1967 proxy-slot inspection,
  EIP-1167 minimal-proxy detection, selector recovery, storage inspection,
  and raw JSON-RPC access;
- adding Foundry and Hardhat build integration;
- replacing chain-specific test fixtures, rules, documentation, and automation.

Original authorship and license notices are retained where required. This notice
does not imply endorsement by FuzzingLabs or Robinhood.
